! ============================================================================
! twol/rules-shaanxi.twol  —  SHAANXI two-level rules
!
! Complete rule set for the Shaanxi build: the shared boundary-deletion rules
! PLUS Shaanxi-specific morphophonology. Used instead of the common twol when
! building the Shaanxi analyser.
!
! Shaanxi-specific phenomena (Russian Wikipedia "Дунганский язык", 林涛 2012;
! Драгунов 1937):
!   - historical мягкие дь-/ть- (/tj/, /tʰj/) -> җь-/чь- (/tɕ/, /tɕʰ/)
!   - historical /ŋ/ initial often retained where Gansu/Beijing lost it
!
! BUT! These are largely lexicalized in our stems, so the alternation rule is
! recorded as a documented (currently vacuous) constraint, mirroring how the
! common file handles the ў/у case.
! ============================================================================

Alphabet
 А Б В Г Д Е Ё Ж З И Й К Л М Н О П Р С Т У Ф Х Ц Ч Ш Щ Ъ Ы Ь Э Ю Я
 а б в г д е ё ж з и й к л м н о п р с т у ф х ц ч ш щ ъ ы ь э ю я
 Ә ә Ң ң Җ җ Ў ў Ү ү
 %>:0 %+:0
 ;

Sets
 Vowel = а е ё и о у ы э ю я ә ў ү ;
 Cons  = б в г д ж з й к л м н п р с т ф х ц ч ш щ ң җ ;

Rules

! ---- Shared: morpheme/clitic boundary deletion (same as common) ----
! Rule S1: animate-plural boundary %> deletes on the surface.
!   жын%>му  ->  жынму   (人們)
"Plural boundary deletion (Shaanxi)"
%>:0 <=> _ ;

! Rule S2: clitic boundary %+ deletes on the surface.
!   чы%+ли   ->  чыли    (吃哩)
!   ни%+ди   ->  ниди    (你的)
"Clitic boundary deletion (Shaanxi)"
%+:0 <=> _ ;

! ---- Shaanxi-only (DOCUMENTED, vacuous): дь/ть -> җь/чь palatalization ----
! Per 林涛 2012: in Shaanxi Dungan the historical soft initials дь- /tj-/,
! ть- /tʰj-/ surface as җь- /tɕ-/, чь- /tɕʰ-/. Illustration (schematically, at
! the syllable level): underlying дьа -> surface (Shaanxi) җьа; тьи -> чьи.
! Our lexicon stores the already-palatalized Shaanxi forms, so no rewriting is
! needed at this stage. Recorded here for when productive morphology introduces
! the underlying form.
! "dj palatalizes to dzj in Shaanxi"
! д:җ <=> _ ь: ;
